  ('Jarbidge Cemetery', 'jarbidge-cemetery', 'weird-history', 41.8931, -115.4299, 'Jarbidge', 'NV', 'A small mountain cemetery preserves graves from the remote mining settlement and surrounding wilderness community; visit quietly and respectfully.', 'open', 'https://travelnevada.com/cities/jarbidge/', 'America/Los_Angeles'),
